OL,3,GNEWSAMan bailed after teenage girl
OL,4,Araped in city park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested on suspicion of raping a
OL,7,Fteenage girl in a park has been
OL,8,Freleased on conditional bail, police
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FAvon and Somerset Police arrested the
OL,12,Fman, in his late teens, in connection
OL,13,Fwith the incident in Parade Gardens in
OL,14,FBath at about 23:30 GMT on Wednesday,
OL,15,Fbut said they have since released him
OL,16,Fon bail with conditions including an
OL,17,Fovernight curfew.
OL,19,FOfficers added they are supporting the
OL,20,Fvictim and forensic and CCTV
OL,21,Finvestigations are ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
